# Streaking Oilgorger {4}{B}: Flying, haste; Start your engines! (CR 702.179); "Max speed — This creature has lifelink"
# (CR 702.178a). Cast on turn 1 (Black Lotus {B}{B}{B} + Mox Jet + Mox Ruby, exactly {4}{B}) it gives Bot1 speed 1 (CR 704.5aa),
# and with haste it attacks at once: each turn it hits Bot2 (no blockers) it raises the speed once (CR 702.179d): 2 on turn 1,
# 3 on turn 3, 4 on turn 5 - Bot2 at 17, 14, 11 - and Bot1 stays at 20, since below speed 4 it has no lifelink; at speed 3 its
# keywords are Flying and Haste only. The turn 5 hit takes it to max speed after the damage, so still no life gained. On
# turn 7 it has lifelink: Bot2 loses 3 (8) and Bot1 gains 3 (23).

